---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Sell Your Home
permalink: /sell-your-home/
description: Selling your home? Bahr Family Properties buys houses in any condition — vacant or occupied — for our own portfolio in St. Louis and St. Charles County.
intakeForms: true
---
<div class="wrap page">
  <h1>Selling your home? We buy houses — in any condition.</h1>
  <p class="lede">We buy homes for our own portfolio, in St. Louis and St. Charles County.</p>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-h">
    <h2 id="how-h">How we buy</h2>
    <div class="tracks-grid">
      <div class="track-card">
        <h3>Vacant or occupied</h3>
        <p>A tenant in place is fine.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="track-card">
        <h3>Distressed, as-is</h3>
        <p>No repairs, and no cleanout.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="what-h">
    <h2 id="what-h">What we buy</h2>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li>Rental properties</li>
      <li>Single-family homes</li>
      <li>Inherited homes</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="intake-h">
    <h2 id="intake-h">Tell us about the home</h2>
    <p>Your answers come straight to us.</p>
    <form class="intake-form" data-intake-form="sell_inquiry">
      <label>Your name
        <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120">
      </label>
      <label>Your phone
        <input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="40">
      </label>
      <label>Your email
        <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="200">
      </label>
      <label>The property address
        <input type="text" name="property_address" autocomplete="street-address" required maxlength="240">
      </label>
      <label>Is the home occupied or vacant?
        <select name="occupancy">
          <option value="">Not sure / rather not say</option>
          <option value="occupied">Occupied</option>
          <option value="vacant">Vacant</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Its condition, and anything else you want us to know
        <textarea name="message" maxlength="2000"></textarea>
      </label>
      <span class="intake-hp" aria-hidden="true">
        <label>Leave this field empty
          <input type="text" name="bfp_hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        </label>
      </span>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Send</button>
      <p class="intake-status" data-intake-status role="status"></p>
    </form>
    <p>Prefer email? <a href="mailto:bahrfamilyproperties@gmail.com">bahrfamilyproperties@gmail.com</a></p>
  </section>
</div>
